  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Core state",
      "items": [
        "users carries role/user_type, is_active · is_blocked · is_verified, retry_count, the pepper-hashed password and the google_id/github_id columns the social flows link by",
        "sessions hold the opaque refresh token (unique) with ip/ua and an absolute expires_at; audit_logs records admin actions via a narrow Audit port"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Postgres path",
      "items": [
        "every write rides pgx/v5 through pgxpool tucked behind PgBouncer transaction pooling; queries.sql compiles through sqlc into committed internal/gen/db, adapters in postgres.go its only consumers",
        "the email job is enqueued with river.AddTx inside the same pgx transaction as the state change — the outbox pattern without an outbox table"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Delivery + purge",
      "items": [
        "failures follow River's backoff and discard after max attempts — at-least-once without a claim CTE or sending lease",
        "river.PeriodicJobs (cron) covers the old janitor: expired sessions and code rows purged hourly with idempotent DELETEs — audit rows untouched"
      ]
    }
  ]
}